{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"14":"Fasting (Kitab Al-Siyam)"},"section_detail":{"14":{"hadithnumber_first":2313,"hadithnumber_last":2476,"arabicnumber_first":2313,"arabicnumber_last":2476,"name_native":"كتاب الصيام"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2358,"arabicnumber":2358,"text":"حدثنا مسدد، حدثنا هشيم، عن حصين، عن معاذ بن زهرة، انه بلغه ان النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم كان اذا افطر قال \" اللهم لك صمت وعلى رزقك افطرت","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sanad Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":14,"hadith":46}}]}